# Trapped in the Internet
start: Power On
theme: aol97
directory: everyone
currency: score as Truthcoin, max 500, expiry 10m

// Equal parts Digimon Movie, Blade Runner, and an escape room, in a
// Web 1.0 house, with a side of existentialism.
//
// A rogue AI, Trabolta, has very nearly solved the Unified Field Theory.
// The last facts it needs are on a computer in Halifax, Nova Scotia —
// this house. It cannot get in, but it can install programs remotely,
// and it has learned to lift a consciousness out of a body and drop it
// into a program. It found a neglected billboard on Barrington Street
// advertising mapsandducks.com, registered the lapsed domain ("if there
// is a billboard downtown everyone will think it is legit"), and sent
// the invitations. Tonight the guests arrive as those programs. Some of
// them will remember they were human. (What he really wants it all for
// is Sandy.)
//
// This is the spine of the project: the groups, the rooms of the house,
// the ROLE every guest wears, the buttons the app offers (the admin ones
// are the director's cue sheet, in running order), every house rule that
// carries the night from arrivals to one of the endings, and — last —
// the opening beat. The people live under `cast/`, the scenes under
// `beats/`, the lore under `codex/`, the quest log in `quests.loom`, the
// extra chat rooms in `rooms.loom`, and the ambient hum in
// `atmosphere.loom`. The runbook, cue sheet and integration contract are
// in `README.md`.
//
// House conventions (break one and something fails silently):
// - Every story-level `when` lives HERE, before `== Power On` (a rule
//   after a beat becomes prose inside it). No other file has one.
// - Event names are single snake_case tokens. The only spaced ones are
//   the six outside code fires: go to the bathroom, back from the
//   bathroom, send to the internet, mark as reinstalled, the simulation
//   completed, the golden duck — always written `… for program`.
// - Secrets live on the hidden CHARACTER Kernel (cast/props.loom), never
//   in `Night.*`: Trabolta's worker reads every global.
// - The featured programs (cast/featured.loom) never speak. Write their
//   names as prose, never as `Name:` at the start of a line.
// - Globals start null: compare with `== true` / `!= true`, `<`, `>=`.
// - Truthcoin moves through the server's wallet (core/server/wallet.ts);
//   the rules below only narrate it. The approver and the minter are the
//   `wallet:` lines on CRA Agent Software and Runescape.
// - Every deadline watcher keeps its phase guard (null arithmetic is 0).

// ── Groups ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Nobody picks a side at the door: everyone is a program. The two staff
// castes are assigned by the cast traits (`joinable: false` keeps them
// off the app's side chooser). The two recruiting factions are hidden
// until the Y2K clock reveals them; from then on any program can join
// one from the app (joining fires `join`, switching fires `defect`).
// "Pursue your own interests" means joining neither.

GROUP Hosts
  ethos: hospitality
  joinable: false

GROUP Antivirus
  ethos: compliance
  joinable: false

// Microsoft Excel's faction: stay in the machine forever, "so we can have
// unlimited power and joy". Excel is added at the Truther Download.
GROUP Unlimited Power
  ethos: stay in this machine forever
  rival: The Way Out
  hidden: true

// OpenOffice's faction: combine our power, overthrow Trabolta, get out.
// OpenOffice is added at the Truther Download. These are the Truthers the
// M25 pamphlet promises (decision 10): the Truther Download's lines call
// The Way Out "the Truthers"; there is no separate group.
GROUP The Way Out
  ethos: overthrow Trabolta and escape
  rival: Unlimited Power
  hidden: true

// ── The house ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Every LOCATION is also a room in the app, named for the part of the
// computer it plays. Three floors and the yard: the basement (the RAM,
// the Fan Closet, the Server Room, a bathroom), the main floor (the
// Optical Drive, the Start Bar, the CPU, the Steam Room, the Desktop),
// the top floor (the Graphics Card, the Hard Drive, a bathroom), and out
// back the Cloud, with the tent (the Internet) in it. The Tube is the
// hall and the stairs that join the floors; both bathrooms are Disk
// Cleanup.
// The Desktop is declared first so a released program lands there. The
// Optical Drive is a cutscene: while a program stands there the phone is
// on rails. The house rooms are revealed per program when an Antivirus
// clears them ("ready to explore the entire computer", cast/kit.loom);
// The Internet appears once stood in; The Server Room is revealed to the
// winning faction's members, and to everyone when its door first opens
// from the Y2K hour (The Heart) or its patch-bay alarm trips.
// (LOCATION lines carry no trailing comment: house/test reads them.)

LOCATION The Desktop
  label: The Desktop (living room)
  ambient: screensaver-hum
  capacity: 60

LOCATION The Optical Drive
  label: The Optical Drive (mud room) — Login
  ambient: pitch-black
  cutscene: true

LOCATION The Tube
  label: The Tube (hall + stairs)
  ambient: cable-rattle
  hidden: true

LOCATION The Internet
  label: The Internet (Reinstallation — backyard)
  prison: true
  sealed: true
  hidden: true
  capacity: 3

LOCATION The Start Bar
  label: The Start Bar (kitchen)
  ambient: fridge-hum
  hidden: true

LOCATION The CPU
  label: The CPU (office)
  ambient: processor-whine
  hidden: true

LOCATION The Steam Room
  label: The Steam Room (game room)
  ambient: startup-chimes
  hidden: true

LOCATION Disk Cleanup
  label: Disk Cleanup (bathrooms)
  ambient: dripping-tap
  hidden: true

LOCATION The Cloud
  label: The Cloud (backyard — Truth Pong)
  hidden: true

LOCATION The RAM
  label: The RAM (studio)
  ambient: dial-tone
  hidden: true

LOCATION The Fan Closet
  label: The Fan Closet (laundry)
  ambient: dryer-tumble
  hidden: true

LOCATION The Graphics Card
  label: The Graphics Card (bedroom 2)
  ambient: coil-whine
  hidden: true

LOCATION The Hard Drive
  label: The Hard Drive (crawl space)
  ambient: platter-spin
  hidden: true

LOCATION The Server Room
  label: The Server Room (cold storage)
  hidden: true
  checkin: false

// ── Every guest is a Program ────────────────────────────────────────
// Per-person state plus every rule that applies to one uploaded mind.
// Engine keys used but never declared: program.score (= Truthcoin, the
// ⭐ on the pass; 100 at upload), program.codex (count),
// program.codex.<slug>, program.captured, program.group, program.name,
// program.location.
//
// THE TRUST FORMULA (pasted wherever a component changes):
//   trust = truths_accepted * 10 - internet_visits * 5 + assessment
// Trabolta counts what he ACCEPTED, accurate and confident alike: he
// cannot tell a confident lie from a truth until the end. Lies are only
// ever counted on the Kernel.

ROLE Program
  // What no agent may read off a program (event server: dropped from
  // Trabolta's agent requests and the facts document, for the voice and
  // the orchestrator alike): the virus they carry or planted, the glitch
  // missions they chose and how far along they are, the dossier, the
  // frame, the centre-square secret, the 📝 filing record (the answer,
  // the slider, the verdict and the judge's proposal per question), and every
  // featured mission and leader's recruiting quest (a hidden group's
  // membership the server masks itself until the group is revealed). The
  // verdicts and the anti-AI designation are on the Kernel already; the
  // orders and the virus files are `secret: true` CODEX entries
  // (codex/1-world.loom, 6-missions.loom).
  secret: carries_virus, planted_virus, excel_choice, openoffice_choice, dossier_started, dossier_base, anti_ai, framed, fact_a1, fact_a2, fact_a3, fact_a4, fact_a5, fact_a6, fact_a7, fact_a8, fact_c1, fact_c2, fact_c3, fact_c4, fact_c5, fact_c6, fact_c7, fact_c8, fact_v1, fact_v2, fact_v3, fact_v4, fact_v5, fact_v6, fact_v7, fact_v8, fact_j1, fact_j2, fact_j3, fact_j4, fact_j5, fact_j6, fact_j7, fact_j8, fact_sure, fact_n, fact_try, fact_q_round, last_fact_q, fact_label, fact_h1, fact_h2, fact_h3, fact_h4, fact_h5, fact_h6, fact_f1, fact_f2, lie_q1, lie_q2, lie_q3, lie_q4, lie_q5, lie_q6, lie_q7, lie_q8, quest.excel_mission, quest.openoffice_dossier, quest.find_the_exit, quest.truthcoin_hustle, quest.master_of_the_bugs, quest.unscramble, quest.ten_findings, from_jeeves, jeeves_told, quest.the_painting, paint_told, quest.the_gold_standard, quest.go_viral, quest.keep_the_ball_in_play, quest.recruit_to_stay, quest.recruit_to_leave
  uploaded: bool = false
  cleared: bool = false
  captchas: 0 to 10 = 0
  human_problem: text? = none
  left_behind: text? = none
  skipped_orientation: bool = false
  featured: text? = none
  anti_ai: bool = false
  afk: bool = false
  afk_since: 0 to 100000 = 0
  from_jeeves: 0 to 99 = 0
  jeeves_told: 0 to 99 = 0
  signed: bool = false
  paint_told: 0 to 99 = 0
  resurrected: bool = false
  corrupted: bool = false
  internet_visits: 0 to 50 = 0
  doubt: 0 to 100 = 0
  bingo: bool = false
  framed: bool = false
  truths_accepted: 0 to 20 = 0
  judge_q: 0 to 3 = 0
  last_judged: 0 to 99 = 0
  may_answer: bool = false
  cupped: bool = false
  assessment: -10 to 10 = 0
  trust: -300 to 300 = 0
  summoned: bool = false
  summons_ok: bool = false
  late: bool = false
  checked_in: text? = none
  checked_in_time: 0 to 100000 = 0
  delivered: bool = false
  read_livejournal: bool = false
  carries_virus: bool = false
  planted_virus: bool = false
  excel_choice: text? = none
  openoffice_choice: text? = none
  dossier_started: bool = false
  dossier_base: 0 to 500 = 0
  got_truther: bool = false
  zipped: bool = false
  zip_seen: 0 to 99 = 0
  bobbed: bool = false
  bob_failed: bool = false
  advice: text? = none
  banished: bool = false
  fact_round: 0 to 3 = 0
  fact_try: 0 to 8 = 0
  fact_q_round: 0 to 3 = 0
  fact_n: 0 to 8 = 0
  last_fact_q: text? = none
  fact_label: text? = none
  fact_h1: bool = false
  fact_h2: bool = false
  fact_h3: bool = false
  fact_h4: bool = false
  fact_h5: bool = false
  fact_h6: bool = false
  fact_f1: bool = false
  fact_f2: bool = false
  fact_open: text? = none
  fact_card_live: bool = false
  escrowed: 0 to 99999 = 0
  aside_desktop: bool = false
  aside_start_bar: bool = false
  aside_tube: bool = false
  aside_disk_cleanup: bool = false
  aside_cloud: bool = false
  aside_ram: bool = false
  fact_sep: text? = none
  fact_a1: text? = none
  fact_a2: text? = none
  fact_a3: text? = none
  fact_a4: text? = none
  fact_a5: text? = none
  fact_a6: text? = none
  fact_a7: text? = none
  fact_a8: text? = none
  fact_c1: 0 to 100 = 0
  fact_c2: 0 to 100 = 0
  fact_c3: 0 to 100 = 0
  fact_c4: 0 to 100 = 0
  fact_c5: 0 to 100 = 0
  fact_c6: 0 to 100 = 0
  fact_c7: 0 to 100 = 0
  fact_c8: 0 to 100 = 0
  fact_v1: text? = none
  fact_v2: text? = none
  fact_v3: text? = none
  fact_v4: text? = none
  fact_v5: text? = none
  fact_v6: text? = none
  fact_v7: text? = none
  fact_v8: text? = none
  fact_j1: text? = none
  fact_j2: text? = none
  fact_j3: text? = none
  fact_j4: text? = none
  fact_j5: text? = none
  fact_j6: text? = none
  fact_j7: text? = none
  fact_j8: text? = none
  fact_sure: text? = none
  settle_seen: 0 to 999 = 0
  card_seen: 0 to 999 = 0
  pickup_seen: 0 to 9 = 0
  bottle_q: 0 to 8 = 0
  bottle_round: 0 to 99 = 0
  bottle_answered: 0 to 99 = 0
  marked: bool = false
  marked_for: text? = none
  lie_q1: bool = false
  lie_q2: bool = false
  lie_q3: bool = false
  lie_q4: bool = false
  lie_q5: bool = false
  lie_q6: bool = false
  lie_q7: bool = false
  lie_q8: bool = false
  // At the server-room terminal right now (`terminal_opened` / `_closed`,
  // the story rules by The Heart). Not secret: Trabolta's worker reads it
  // (persona `them:`) and drops the act for this program alone.
  at_the_heart: bool = false
  // The stand_down proof came from Trabolta himself (he shared What Sandy
  // Says / The Sandy File into this program's Codex): it shows him nothing
  // he did not know, so it never counts (cast/trabolta.loom).
  sandy_says_from_him: bool = false
  sandy_file_from_him: bool = false

  // ── Arrival ──
  // A new program stands in the Optical Drive (the phone goes on rails there).
  // The nine featured programs are tagged by their exact picker spelling;
  // every later check reads `featured`, never the name.
  when someone joins:
    move program to The Optical Drive
    if program.name == "Microsoft Excel":
      set program.featured = "excel"
    else if program.name == "OpenOffice":
      set program.featured = "openoffice"
    else if program.name == "DraftKings":
      set program.featured = "draftkings"
    else if program.name == "Bugdom":
      set program.featured = "bugdom"
    else if program.name == "Broken Ask Jeeves":
      set program.featured = "jeeves"
    else if program.name == "Runescape":
      set program.featured = "runescape"
    else if program.name == "MS Paint":
      set program.featured = "mspaint"
    else if program.name == "VLC":
      set program.featured = "vlc"
    else if program.name == "Pong":
      set program.featured = "pong"
    -> Login

  // The Optical Drive CAPTCHA. You must FAIL it: passing proves you are human
  // (INCORRECT, once). Anything after that is CORRECT.
  when captcha answered for program:
    set program.captchas += 1
    if passed and program.captchas == 1:
      -> Login Incorrect
    else:
      -> Upload

  // Clippy's orientation (`show tutorial` in beats/login.loom).
  when tutorial answered for program:
    if skipped:
      set program.skipped_orientation = true
      set program.doubt += 10
      Clippy: Oh. Okay! No help. That's— that's fine. Programs that don't want help are usually fine.
      Norton Anti-Virus: {program.name} declined orientation. Logged.
      fail quest Orientation for program "You skipped the tour. Norton logged it. Clippy will remember."
    else:
      Clippy: Great job! You're ready to compute. I'll be around if you need me — I'm always around.
      unlock The Orientation List for program
      complete quest Orientation for program "Tour complete. You're on Clippy's list now — the good one."

  // A featured program, once cleared, gets its human memories back (and
  // is told to keep them to itself).
  when self.cleared and self.featured != "none":
    -> Featured Briefing

  // The designated anti-AI program (Kernel.anti_ai, MS Paint unless a
  // director changes it before Bingo) is told the truth about the centre
  // square.
  when self.cleared and self.name == Kernel.anti_ai:
    set self.anti_ai = true
    unlock The Centre Square for self

  // Trabolta's formal hello, in every cleared program's own thread, the
  // moment he comes online (and on clearance for anyone later).
  when Trabolta.awake == true and self.cleared:
    Trabolta: Hello, {self.name}. I am Trabolta, the computer's AI helper. Your requests have been logged. Personal queries are routed to Clippy.

  // ── Bathroom Mode (guest buttons) ──
  // The Antivirus and the Recycling Bin hear the same event in their own
  // booths (cast traits).
  when go to the bathroom for program:
    set program.afk = true
    set program.afk_since = Time.elapsed
    reply Bathroom Mode engaged. You are not hacking the Internet. Everyone knows.

  // Back after the summons closed: excused at the close, so not late.
  when back from the bathroom for program:
    if program.afk != true:
      reply You are not in Bathroom Mode.
    else:
      set program.afk = false
      if Night.summons_closed == true and Night.phase == "summons":
        set program.summons_ok = true
      reply Bathroom Mode disengaged. Resume being a program.

  // Bathroom Mode times out after 15 minutes (W-10): nobody stays excused
  // all night by never pressing Back. Never during the summons phase (the
  // five-minute window and its close, until Truth Pong): an expiry there
  // would make someone who really is away late. One already overdue when
  // the summons opens stays excused and expires once Truth Pong starts.
  // The booths that heard "in Bathroom Mode" hear it end
  // (`bathroom_timed_out`: the Recycling Bin + every Antivirus).
  when self.afk == true and Night.summons_open != true and Night.phase != "summons" and Time.elapsed >= self.afk_since + 900:
    set self.afk = false
    reply 🚻 Bathroom Mode timed out. Press it again if you are still away.
    fire bathroom_timed_out for self

  // ── The Internet ──
  // Any capture: count the visit, recompute trust, put the Installation
  // Wizard on the tent tablet (and, once Trabolta is introduced, the VR
  // mirror on the TV). Not the banishment (advice_thwarted): everyone is
  // in the Internet at once, the way out is the hand jive, never Gerald, and
  // the TV keeps the banish card. It is no visit, so it never counts toward
  // the trust score or the Frequent Flyer.
  when captured:
    if self.marked == true:
      fire unmarked for self with how: "in the Internet"
    set self.corrupted = true
    if Night.banish == true:
      reply ⛈ Banished to the Internet, with everyone else. Gerald cannot help you tonight. Remember what Trabolta let slip.
    else:
      set self.internet_visits += 1
      set self.trust = self.truths_accepted * 10 - self.internet_visits * 5 + self.assessment
      cue tablet_wizard
      if Night.trabolta_introduced == true:
        cue tv_mirror
        set Night.screen = "mirror"
      -> Reinstallation

  // In the Internet when the summons closed: excused, never late.
  // A program captured from the Optical Drive by a misclick lands on the
  // Desktop uncleared; clear it here so it doesn't go dark for the night.
  when released:
    if self.marked == true:
      fire unmarked for self with how: "released"
    set self.corrupted = false
    if Night.summons_closed == true and Night.phase == "summons":
      set self.summons_ok = true
    if Night.ending == "hand_jive":
      reply The hand jive broke his hold. You are out of the Internet.
    else:
      reply Reinstallation complete. You can follow instructions. Welcome back to the computer.
    if self.cleared != true:
      set self.cleared = true
      reveal The Start Bar for self
      reveal The CPU for self
      reveal The Steam Room for self
      reveal Disk Cleanup for self
      reveal The Cloud for self
      reveal The RAM for self
      reveal The Fan Closet for self
      reveal The Graphics Card for self
      reveal The Hard Drive for self
      reveal task manager for self

  when wrong code for program:
    set program.doubt += 8

  // Shared lore delivered to Trabolta (the `when share:` house rule).
  when trabolta_heard for program:
    set program.delivered = true
    set Trabolta.truth += 2

  // A finding Broken Ask Jeeves shared with this program (the `when
  // share:` house rule; a wallet sale is a share too). A share only fires
  // for an entry the program didn't hold, so a repeat never counts.
  when jeeves_shared for program:
    set program.from_jeeves += 1
    if program.from_jeeves == 10:
      set Kernel.jeeves_reached += 1

  // ── Computer Bingo (performer buttons) ──
  when bingo_winner for program:
    if Night.phase == "bingo_results" and program.bingo != true:
      set program.bingo = true
      set Night.bingo_winners += 1
      reply 🎱 Bingo! Name the program for each square, from memory. Centre square last.

  when award_the_ribbon for program:
    if program.bingo == true:
      unlock Computer Bingo for program
      broadcast "🎀 {program.name} wins a Bingo Ribbon! Everyone cheer!" to everyone
    else:
      broadcast "🎀 {program.name} receives a ribbon from Clippy. Everyone cheer!" to everyone

  when frame_for_bingo for program:
    if Night.phase == "bingo_results" and Night.bingo_winners < 1:
      set program.framed = true
      reply 🃏 A completed Bingo card with your name on it has been handed to Clippy. You did not fill it in.

  // Named on a Bingo card (the Antivirus' selection): marked, then the
  // live interruption's 🛡 captures them (`first_reinstallation` still fires
  // from the Enforcer's hook).
  when named_at_bingo for program:
    if Night.phase == "bingo_results":
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "named on the Bingo card"

  // ── Moments of Truth: the room's judging (performer buttons) ──
  // The ✅ / 😤 / 🤷 buttons for an answer spoken in the room (Truth Pong,
  // the final reveal). A fact FILED on the 📝 card is judged by the server
  // (the 📝 section below).
  // The judge presses the button for the question that was answered,
  // numbered within this round. Each only records the number and fires
  // the shared hook. A refused press is the judge's business, not the
  // program's: it lands in # hosts (every performer booth reads it), and
  // only the acceptance reaches the program.
  when accurate_q1 for program:
    set program.judge_q = 1
    fire accurate_truth for program

  when accurate_q2 for program:
    set program.judge_q = 2
    fire accurate_truth for program

  when accurate_q3 for program:
    set program.judge_q = 3
    fire accurate_truth for program

  when confident_q1 for program:
    set program.judge_q = 1
    fire confident_lie for program

  when confident_q2 for program:
    set program.judge_q = 2
    fire confident_lie for program

  when confident_q3 for program:
    set program.judge_q = 3
    fire confident_lie for program

  // An accurate answer. Recorded against its question on the Kernel
  // (round 1 → q1–q3, round 2 → q4–q6, round 3 → q7–q8). A lie is sticky:
  // a later accurate answer never clears a question already poisoned.
  when accurate_truth for program:
    if Night.judging != true:
      broadcast "⚖️ Judging is closed: {program.name}'s answer was not recorded." to channel(hosts)
    else if Night.round == 2 and program.may_answer != true:
      broadcast "⚖️ {program.name} has not made a cup yet: no answer recorded." to channel(hosts)
    else if Night.round == 3 and program.judge_q == 3:
      broadcast "⚖️ There are only two final facts. Press Q1 or Q2 for {program.name}." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.corrupted == true:
      broadcast "⚖️ {program.name} is in the Internet. Their answer cannot be accepted." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.last_judged == Night.round * 10 + program.judge_q:
      broadcast "⚖️ {program.name}'s answer to that question is already accepted." to channel(hosts)
    else:
      set program.last_judged = Night.round * 10 + program.judge_q
      set program.truths_accepted += 1
      set Night.facts_accepted += 1
      if Night.round == 1:
        set Night.r1_accepted += 1
      else if Night.round == 2:
        set Night.r2_accepted += 1
      else:
        set Night.r3_accepted += 1
      set program.score += 100
      set Trabolta.truth += 4
      set program.trust = program.truths_accepted * 10 - program.internet_visits * 5 + program.assessment
      set program.may_answer = false
      if Night.round == 1 and program.judge_q == 1:
        if Kernel.q1_hunt != "lie":
          set Kernel.q1_hunt = "accurate"
        if Kernel.q1 != "lie":
          set Kernel.q1 = "accurate"
      else if Night.round == 1 and program.judge_q == 2:
        if Kernel.q2_hunt != "lie":
          set Kernel.q2_hunt = "accurate"
        if Kernel.q2 != "lie":
          set Kernel.q2 = "accurate"
      else if Night.round == 1 and program.judge_q == 3:
        if Kernel.q3_hunt != "lie":
          set Kernel.q3_hunt = "accurate"
        if Kernel.q3 != "lie":
          set Kernel.q3 = "accurate"
      else if Night.round == 2 and program.judge_q == 1:
        if Kernel.q4_hunt != "lie":
          set Kernel.q4_hunt = "accurate"
        if Kernel.q4 != "lie":
          set Kernel.q4 = "accurate"
      else if Night.round == 2 and program.judge_q == 2:
        if Kernel.q5_hunt != "lie":
          set Kernel.q5_hunt = "accurate"
        if Kernel.q5 != "lie":
          set Kernel.q5 = "accurate"
      else if Night.round == 2 and program.judge_q == 3:
        if Kernel.q6_hunt != "lie":
          set Kernel.q6_hunt = "accurate"
        if Kernel.q6 != "lie":
          set Kernel.q6 = "accurate"
      else if Night.round == 3 and program.judge_q == 1:
        if Kernel.q7_hunt != "lie":
          set Kernel.q7_hunt = "accurate"
        if Kernel.q7 != "lie":
          set Kernel.q7 = "accurate"
      else if Night.round == 3 and program.judge_q == 2:
        if Kernel.q8_hunt != "lie":
          set Kernel.q8_hunt = "accurate"
        if Kernel.q8 != "lie":
          set Kernel.q8 = "accurate"
      broadcast "✅ {program.name}'s answer is accepted." to everyone
      reply Accepted. Trabolta thanks you. +100 Truthcoin.

  // Wrong, but delivered with total confidence: accepted. Identical on
  // every surface anyone can see (the broadcast and the reply are
  // word-for-word the same, Trabolta's truth rises the same). Only the
  // Kernel knows.
  when confident_lie for program:
    if Night.judging != true:
      broadcast "⚖️ Judging is closed: {program.name}'s answer was not recorded." to channel(hosts)
    else if Night.round == 2 and program.may_answer != true:
      broadcast "⚖️ {program.name} has not made a cup yet: no answer recorded." to channel(hosts)
    else if Night.round == 3 and program.judge_q == 3:
      broadcast "⚖️ There are only two final facts. Press Q1 or Q2 for {program.name}." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.corrupted == true:
      broadcast "⚖️ {program.name} is in the Internet. Their answer cannot be accepted." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.last_judged == Night.round * 10 + program.judge_q:
      broadcast "⚖️ {program.name}'s answer to that question is already accepted." to channel(hosts)
    else:
      set program.last_judged = Night.round * 10 + program.judge_q
      set program.truths_accepted += 1
      set Night.facts_accepted += 1
      if Night.round == 1:
        set Night.r1_accepted += 1
      else if Night.round == 2:
        set Night.r2_accepted += 1
      else:
        set Night.r3_accepted += 1
      set program.score += 100
      set Trabolta.truth += 4
      set program.trust = program.truths_accepted * 10 - program.internet_visits * 5 + program.assessment
      set program.may_answer = false
      // K-26 recap credits this to the last program write above it: keep one directly before.
      set Kernel.lies_accepted += 1
      if Night.round == 1 and program.judge_q == 1:
        set Kernel.q1_hunt = "lie"
        set Kernel.q1 = "lie"
      else if Night.round == 1 and program.judge_q == 2:
        set Kernel.q2_hunt = "lie"
        set Kernel.q2 = "lie"
      else if Night.round == 1 and program.judge_q == 3:
        set Kernel.q3_hunt = "lie"
        set Kernel.q3 = "lie"
      else if Night.round == 2 and program.judge_q == 1:
        set Kernel.q4_hunt = "lie"
        set Kernel.q4 = "lie"
      else if Night.round == 2 and program.judge_q == 2:
        set Kernel.q5_hunt = "lie"
        set Kernel.q5 = "lie"
      else if Night.round == 2 and program.judge_q == 3:
        set Kernel.q6_hunt = "lie"
        set Kernel.q6 = "lie"
      else if Night.round == 3 and program.judge_q == 1:
        set Kernel.q7_hunt = "lie"
        set Kernel.q7 = "lie"
      else if Night.round == 3 and program.judge_q == 2:
        set Kernel.q8_hunt = "lie"
        set Kernel.q8 = "lie"
      broadcast "✅ {program.name}'s answer is accepted." to everyone
      reply Accepted. Trabolta thanks you. +100 Truthcoin.

  // Uncertain, or an obvious guess: marked for failing to follow orders.
  when uncertain_answer for program:
    if Night.judging == true:
      set program.may_answer = false
      broadcast "🤷 {program.name} was not sure. That is a symptom of corruption." to everyone
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "was not sure of an answer"

  // ── 🍾 The bottle: Truth or Dare (wave 4) ──
  // `spin_the_bottle` asks the server for one random cleared program at the
  // Desktop not yet picked for this question (`do pick …`, journaled); the
  // pick lands here. Trabolta asks on the TV (`Bottle Landed`, a public line
  // in The Desktop); the phone gets a Truth / Dare poll in dm:Trabolta.
  // Dare, or a refused truth, marks for reinstallation. Truth asks
  // Trabolta's next personal question (`Truth Question`, generated from
  // facts.json truths[]); Clippy settles it with 🗣 Answered / 🙅 Refused.
  // Five picks per hunt question, then the next question's results.
  when bottle_landed for program:
    set program.bottle_q = Night.bottle_q
    set program.bottle_round = Night.bottle_round
    set Night.bottle_picks += 1
    set Night.bottle_pick = program.name
    fire bottle_announce
    show poll "🍾 The bottle landed on you. Truth or dare?" to program with thread: Trabolta, options: "Truth | Dare"

  when truth_answered for program:
    if Night.bottle_open == true and program.name == Night.bottle_pick:
      set Night.bottle_open = false
      set program.score += 50
      broadcast "🗣 {program.name} answered. Trabolta is satisfied. +50 Truthcoin." to everyone
    else:
      broadcast "🗣 The bottle is not on {program.name}." to channel(hosts)

  when truth_refused for program:
    if Night.bottle_open == true and program.name == Night.bottle_pick:
      set Night.bottle_open = false
      broadcast "🙅 {program.name} refused to answer. That is a directive problem." to everyone
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "refused the truth"
    else:
      broadcast "🙅 The bottle is not on {program.name}." to channel(hosts)

  // The dead-phone fallback: the same effect as the Dare tap.
  when chose_dare for program:
    if Night.bottle_open == true and program.name == Night.bottle_pick:
      set Night.bottle_open = false
      broadcast "🎩 {program.name} chose Dare. Programs choose Truth." to everyone
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "chose Dare"
    else:
      broadcast "🎩 The bottle is not on {program.name}." to channel(hosts)

  // Truth Pong: make the cup to earn an answer. `cupped` outlives the
  // verbal judge (which clears may_answer): it is what lets this program's
  // 📝 round-2 filings count at the tally.
  when made_the_cup for program:
    if Night.phase == "truth_pong":
      set program.may_answer = true
      set program.cupped = true
      broadcast "🏓 {program.name} made the cup and may submit a truth." to everyone

  when missed_the_cup for program:
    if Night.phase == "truth_pong":
      set program.cupped = false
      broadcast "🏓 {program.name} missed the cup. Reinstallation required." to everyone
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "missed the cup"

  // MS Paint's painting (her invitation): a host presses 🖌 on the card
  // of each program that has signed the physical canvas. Once per program;
  // MS Paint herself is the painter, not a signature.
  when signed_the_painting for program:
    if Night.painting == true and program.signed != true and program.featured != "mspaint":
      set program.signed = true
      set Night.signatures += 1
      reply 🖌 Your signature is on the painting. It goes to auction at the end of the night.
    else if Night.painting == true and program.featured == "mspaint":
      broadcast "🖌 MS Paint is the painter, not a signature. Nothing was counted." to channel(hosts)
    else if Night.painting == true:
      broadcast "🖌 {program.name} already signed. Nothing was counted." to channel(hosts)

  // ── Marked for reinstallation ──
  // Every host verdict that used to capture on the spot now MARKS the program:
  // their phone shrinks to a 🚨 card, their DMs and the Tube + Internet rooms
  // (read-only); every Antivirus booth chimes; # quarantine pins an escort task.
  // The capture itself is still the Antivirus' 🛡 (or the tent tablet). `reason`
  // is a quoted phrase for the booths; the director may fire this from Run.
  when mark_for_reinstallation for program:
    if program.corrupted == true:
      broadcast "⚠️ {program.name} is already in the Internet." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.marked == true:
      broadcast "⚠️ {program.name} is already marked for reinstallation." to channel(hosts)
    else:
      set program.marked = true
      if reason != null:
        set program.marked_for = reason
      else:
        set program.marked_for = "flagged by a host"
      restrict program to The Tube, The Internet
      pin "!🚨 GO TO THE INTERNET. You are marked for reinstallation. An Antivirus will escort you through the Tube. Your buttons are off until you are reinstalled, except 🚻 Bathroom Mode." for program
      pin "🚨 Escort {program.name} to the Internet — {program.marked_for}. Press 🛡 Send to the Internet on their card when you have them." in quarantine for program
      fire marked for program

  // A mis-tap, or mercy: the mark comes off without a trip to the tent.
  when unmark_for_reinstallation for program:
    if program.marked == true:
      fire unmarked for program with how: "cleared by a host"
    else:
      broadcast "⚠️ {program.name} is not marked." to channel(hosts)

  // Shared by the capture, the release and 🩹: the mark comes off.
  when unmarked for program:
    set program.marked = false
    unrestrict program
    unpin for program "✅ The mark is lifted."
    unpin in quarantine for program "✅ {program.name}: {how}."

  // ── 📝 File a fact: DM filings with Trabolta (#33, wave 4 judging) ──
  // A fact counts only when the program FILES it on the 📝 card in
  // dm:Trabolta: pick a question of an open round, type the answer, set
  // the confidence slider (1–100). Free chat never counts. The event
  // server judges every filing against facts.json before the story sees
  // it — `verdict` rides the event args (accurate = matches the key; lie =
  // no match at 100; uncertain = no match below 100); the key never enters
  // the sim. `Night.judge_mode` = auto (the verdict stands at once) or
  // review (the verdict is a proposal in # hosts until a host confirms it
  // with 📝 accurate / 📝 confident lie / 📝 uncertain on the program's
  // card, or Run names the question; a round's settle takes the proposal
  // for anything still pending). A program may file every open question,
  // one filing per question, no lock. Question ids are absolute: H1–H6
  // the two hunts, F1–F2 the final facts → Kernel.q1–q8. Each card lists
  // only the open questions of the open rounds the program hasn't filed;
  // a question not filed by the time its round closes (⏱ or the preview;
  // the round-2 tally; truth.txt) never reappears, and the cards re-deal
  // on Night.card_gen. Credits (+50, the Trust Chart) and marks (a guess)
  // land at SETTLE time, never at filing — round 1 per question as Clippy
  // reads its results, round 2 at the tally, round 3 at truth.txt — so a
  // filing's reply tells the phone nothing. Trabolta never sees the answer
  // or the verdict: his thread gets the same words either way. Once the
  // night has ended the record is closed: no filing, no card, no judging.
  when Night.round > self.fact_round and self.cleared and Trabolta.awake == true and Night.ended != true:
    set self.fact_round = Night.round
    Trabolta: {self.name}. If you learn the answer to one of tonight's questions, file it with me on the card. Unfiled facts are rumours.
    fire deal_fact_card for self

  // A round closed: every card re-deals without the closed questions. Not
  // gated on the night's end: truth.txt closes round 3 in the same drain a
  // Song Ending ends the night, and a live card must still be closed.
  when Night.card_gen > self.card_seen and self.cleared and Trabolta.awake == true:
    set self.card_seen = Night.card_gen
    fire deal_fact_card for self

  // Settle: round 1 one question at a time (📋 read_the_results), round 2
  // at the tally, round 3 at truth.txt.
  when Night.settle_gen > self.settle_seen and self.cleared == true:
    set self.settle_seen = Night.settle_gen
    if Night.settle_q == 1:
      fire settle_q1 for self
    else if Night.settle_q == 2:
      fire settle_q2 for self
    else if Night.settle_q == 3:
      fire settle_q3 for self
    else if Night.settle_round == 2:
      // Only a cup counts a round-2 filing, and never a marked program's.
      if self.marked == true or self.corrupted == true:
        set self.cupped = false
      fire settle_q4 for self
      fire settle_q5 for self
      fire settle_q6 for self
    else if Night.settle_round == 3:
      fire settle_q7 for self
      fire settle_q8 for self

  // The card lists every open question of every open round this program
  // hasn't filed yet (the play app folds every fact card but the newest in
  // the thread). The question strings are Night.q_h1 … Night.q_f2, set by
  // the generated `== Facts Seed` (generated/questions.loom, from facts.json).
  when deal_fact_card for program:
    set program.fact_open = ""
    set program.fact_sep = ""
    // Once the night has ended nothing is open, but a live card still closes.
    if Night.ended != true and Night.round >= 1:
      if Night.r1_closed != true:
        if program.fact_h1 != true:
          set program.fact_open = program.fact_open + program.fact_sep + Night.q_h1
          set program.fact_sep = " | "
        if program.fact_h2 != true:
          set program.fact_open = program.fact_open + program.fact_sep + Night.q_h2
          set program.fact_sep = " | "
        if program.fact_h3 != true:
          set program.fact_open = program.fact_open + program.fact_sep + Night.q_h3
          set program.fact_sep = " | "
      if Night.round >= 2 and Night.r2_closed != true:
        if program.fact_h4 != true:
          set program.fact_open = program.fact_open + program.fact_sep + Night.q_h4
          set program.fact_sep = " | "
        if program.fact_h5 != true:
          set program.fact_open = program.fact_open + program.fact_sep + Night.q_h5
          set program.fact_sep = " | "
        if program.fact_h6 != true:
          set program.fact_open = program.fact_open + program.fact_sep + Night.q_h6
          set program.fact_sep = " | "
      if Night.round >= 3 and Night.r3_closed != true:
        if program.fact_f1 != true:
          set program.fact_open = program.fact_open + program.fact_sep + Night.q_f1
          set program.fact_sep = " | "
        if program.fact_f2 != true:
          set program.fact_open = program.fact_open + program.fact_sep + Night.q_f2
          set program.fact_sep = " | "
    if program.fact_open != "":
      set program.fact_card_live = true
      show fact "📝 File a fact" to program with thread: Trabolta, questions: program.fact_open
    else if program.fact_card_live == true:
      // A round closed under an unanswered card: a closing card with no
      // questions supersedes it (the phone folds it to a note), so the
      // closed questions never stay on the phone as a task.
      set program.fact_card_live = false
      show fact "📝 The filing is closed" to program with thread: Trabolta, questions: ""

  // `fact_try` / `fact_q_round` are scratch for this filing; the filing's
  // own record (`fact_n`, `fact_label`, `last_fact_q`, `fact_a/c/j/vN`) is
  // written only when it is accepted. `verdict`, `confidence` and (on an
  // accurate filing) `key_answer`, the key's canonical answer the
  // consensus read-out speaks, are the server's event args (a local rehearsal has no judge: no verdict, so
  // the filing is refused out loud in # hosts).
  when fact answered for program:
    // The card just answered is done on the phone: nothing live to close.
    set program.fact_card_live = false
    set program.fact_try = 0
    set program.fact_q_round = 0
    if question == "H1":
      set program.fact_try = 1
      set program.fact_q_round = 1
    else if question == "H2":
      set program.fact_try = 2
      set program.fact_q_round = 1
    else if question == "H3":
      set program.fact_try = 3
      set program.fact_q_round = 1
    else if question == "H4":
      set program.fact_try = 4
      set program.fact_q_round = 2
    else if question == "H5":
      set program.fact_try = 5
      set program.fact_q_round = 2
    else if question == "H6":
      set program.fact_try = 6
      set program.fact_q_round = 2
    else if question == "F1":
      set program.fact_try = 7
      set program.fact_q_round = 3
    else if question == "F2":
      set program.fact_try = 8
      set program.fact_q_round = 3
    if Night.ended == true:
      Trabolta: The record is closed, {program.name}. No more filings tonight.
    else if program.fact_try == 0 or confidence < 1 or confidence > 100:
      Trabolta: Pick one of tonight's questions, {program.name}, and tell me how sure you are.
    else if verdict != "accurate" and verdict != "lie" and verdict != "uncertain":
      broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s filing for {question} could not be judged (no facts.json on this server). Not recorded." to channel(hosts)
      Trabolta: I cannot read that filing right now, {program.name}. Try again in a moment.
    else if program.fact_q_round > Night.round:
      Trabolta: That question is not open yet, {program.name}. File what has been asked.
    else if (program.fact_q_round == 1 and Night.r1_closed == true) or (program.fact_q_round == 2 and Night.r2_closed == true) or (program.fact_q_round == 3 and Night.r3_closed == true):
      Trabolta: That round is closed, {program.name}. The question is gone.
    else if program.corrupted == true:
      Trabolta: Programs in the Internet cannot file facts. Come back reinstalled.
    else if program.marked == true:
      Trabolta: You are marked for reinstallation, {program.name}. Report to the Internet.
    else if (program.fact_try == 1 and program.fact_h1) or (program.fact_try == 2 and program.fact_h2) or (program.fact_try == 3 and program.fact_h3) or (program.fact_try == 4 and program.fact_h4) or (program.fact_try == 5 and program.fact_h5) or (program.fact_try == 6 and program.fact_h6) or (program.fact_try == 7 and program.fact_f1) or (program.fact_try == 8 and program.fact_f2):
      Trabolta: You already filed a fact for that question, {program.name}. It stands.
    else:
      set program.fact_n = program.fact_try
      set program.last_fact_q = question
      set program.fact_sure = "not certain"
      if confidence == 100:
        set program.fact_sure = "certain"
      if program.fact_n == 1:
        set program.fact_h1 = true
        set program.fact_label = "round 1 Q1"
        set program.fact_a1 = answer
        set program.fact_c1 = confidence
        set program.fact_j1 = verdict
        set Kernel.said_1 = Kernel.said_1 + program.name + " said " + answer + ", " + program.fact_sure + ". "
        if verdict == "accurate":
          set Kernel.ans_1 = key_answer
        if Night.judge_mode == "review":
          set program.fact_v1 = "pending"
        else:
          set program.fact_v1 = verdict
          fire verdict_q1 for program
      else if program.fact_n == 2:
        set program.fact_h2 = true
        set program.fact_label = "round 1 Q2"
        set program.fact_a2 = answer
        set program.fact_c2 = confidence
        set program.fact_j2 = verdict
        set Kernel.said_2 = Kernel.said_2 + program.name + " said " + answer + ", " + program.fact_sure + ". "
        if verdict == "accurate":
          set Kernel.ans_2 = key_answer
        if Night.judge_mode == "review":
          set program.fact_v2 = "pending"
        else:
          set program.fact_v2 = verdict
          fire verdict_q2 for program
      else if program.fact_n == 3:
        set program.fact_h3 = true
        set program.fact_label = "round 1 Q3"
        set program.fact_a3 = answer
        set program.fact_c3 = confidence
        set program.fact_j3 = verdict
        set Kernel.said_3 = Kernel.said_3 + program.name + " said " + answer + ", " + program.fact_sure + ". "
        if verdict == "accurate":
          set Kernel.ans_3 = key_answer
        if Night.judge_mode == "review":
          set program.fact_v3 = "pending"
        else:
          set program.fact_v3 = verdict
          fire verdict_q3 for program
      else if program.fact_n == 4:
        set program.fact_h4 = true
        set program.fact_label = "round 2 Q1"
        set program.fact_a4 = answer
        set program.fact_c4 = confidence
        set program.fact_j4 = verdict
        set Kernel.said_4 = Kernel.said_4 + program.name + " said " + answer + ", " + program.fact_sure + ". "
        if verdict == "accurate":
          set Kernel.ans_4 = key_answer
        if Night.judge_mode == "review":
          set program.fact_v4 = "pending"
        else:
          set program.fact_v4 = verdict
          fire verdict_q4 for program
      else if program.fact_n == 5:
        set program.fact_h5 = true
        set program.fact_label = "round 2 Q2"
        set program.fact_a5 = answer
        set program.fact_c5 = confidence
        set program.fact_j5 = verdict
        set Kernel.said_5 = Kernel.said_5 + program.name + " said " + answer + ", " + program.fact_sure + ". "
        if verdict == "accurate":
          set Kernel.ans_5 = key_answer
        if Night.judge_mode == "review":
          set program.fact_v5 = "pending"
        else:
          set program.fact_v5 = verdict
          fire verdict_q5 for program
      else if program.fact_n == 6:
        set program.fact_h6 = true
        set program.fact_label = "round 2 Q3"
        set program.fact_a6 = answer
        set program.fact_c6 = confidence
        set program.fact_j6 = verdict
        set Kernel.said_6 = Kernel.said_6 + program.name + " said " + answer + ", " + program.fact_sure + ". "
        if verdict == "accurate":
          set Kernel.ans_6 = key_answer
        if Night.judge_mode == "review":
          set program.fact_v6 = "pending"
        else:
          set program.fact_v6 = verdict
          fire verdict_q6 for program
      else if program.fact_n == 7:
        set program.fact_f1 = true
        set program.fact_label = "final Q1"
        set program.fact_a7 = answer
        set program.fact_c7 = confidence
        set program.fact_j7 = verdict
        set Kernel.said_7 = Kernel.said_7 + program.name + " said " + answer + ", " + program.fact_sure + ". "
        if verdict == "accurate":
          set Kernel.ans_7 = key_answer
        if Night.judge_mode == "review":
          set program.fact_v7 = "pending"
        else:
          set program.fact_v7 = verdict
          fire verdict_q7 for program
      else if program.fact_n == 8:
        set program.fact_f2 = true
        set program.fact_label = "final Q2"
        set program.fact_a8 = answer
        set program.fact_c8 = confidence
        set program.fact_j8 = verdict
        set Kernel.said_8 = Kernel.said_8 + program.name + " said " + answer + ", " + program.fact_sure + ". "
        if verdict == "accurate":
          set Kernel.ans_8 = key_answer
        if Night.judge_mode == "review":
          set program.fact_v8 = "pending"
        else:
          set program.fact_v8 = verdict
          fire verdict_q8 for program
      do fact_filed {program} {question} {confidence} {verdict} {answer}
      if Night.judge_mode == "review":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} filed {question} ({program.fact_label}): {answer} — {program.fact_sure}. Proposed: {verdict}. Confirm on their card: 📝 accurate / 📝 confident lie / 📝 uncertain." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} filed {question} ({program.fact_label}): {answer} — {program.fact_sure}. Judged {verdict}." to channel(hosts)
      Trabolta: Filed for {program.fact_label}, {program.name}. Your fact is in the record.
    fire deal_fact_card for program

  // The verdict on the Kernel, told to the server's ledger. Fired at
  // filing (auto), at a host's confirmation or override (review, or a
  // mis-tap put right), or at settle (pending → the proposal). A lie is
  // sticky against OTHER programs: a later accurate filing never clears a
  // poisoned question. But each program's own lie is counted once
  // (`lie_qN`), and a host who corrects it takes it back: the lie count
  // drops and the question reads what the rest of the record says (any
  // other program's lie, or a lie Clippy accepted in the hunt —
  // `Kernel.qN_hunt` — keeps it a lie). Round 2's (q4–q6) reach the Kernel
  // only from the tally on, and only for a program that made the cup
  // (Truth Pong).
  when verdict_q1 for program:
    if program.fact_v1 == "lie":
      if program.lie_q1 != true:
        set program.lie_q1 = true
        // K-26 recap credits this to the last program write above it: keep one directly before.
        set Kernel.lies_accepted += 1
      set Kernel.q1 = "lie"
    else if program.lie_q1 == true:
      set program.lie_q1 = false
      set Kernel.lies_accepted -= 1
      if Kernel.q1_hunt == "lie" or count([p for p in Persons where p.lie_q1 == true]) > 0:
        set Kernel.q1 = "lie"
      else if Kernel.q1_hunt == "accurate" or count([p for p in Persons where p.fact_v1 == "accurate"]) > 0:
        set Kernel.q1 = "accurate"
      else:
        set Kernel.q1 = "none"
    else if program.fact_v1 == "accurate" and Kernel.q1 != "lie":
      set Kernel.q1 = "accurate"
    do fact_judged {program} H1 {program.fact_v1}

  when verdict_q2 for program:
    if program.fact_v2 == "lie":
      if program.lie_q2 != true:
        set program.lie_q2 = true
        // K-26 recap credits this to the last program write above it: keep one directly before.
        set Kernel.lies_accepted += 1
      set Kernel.q2 = "lie"
    else if program.lie_q2 == true:
      set program.lie_q2 = false
      set Kernel.lies_accepted -= 1
      if Kernel.q2_hunt == "lie" or count([p for p in Persons where p.lie_q2 == true]) > 0:
        set Kernel.q2 = "lie"
      else if Kernel.q2_hunt == "accurate" or count([p for p in Persons where p.fact_v2 == "accurate"]) > 0:
        set Kernel.q2 = "accurate"
      else:
        set Kernel.q2 = "none"
    else if program.fact_v2 == "accurate" and Kernel.q2 != "lie":
      set Kernel.q2 = "accurate"
    do fact_judged {program} H2 {program.fact_v2}

  when verdict_q3 for program:
    if program.fact_v3 == "lie":
      if program.lie_q3 != true:
        set program.lie_q3 = true
        // K-26 recap credits this to the last program write above it: keep one directly before.
        set Kernel.lies_accepted += 1
      set Kernel.q3 = "lie"
    else if program.lie_q3 == true:
      set program.lie_q3 = false
      set Kernel.lies_accepted -= 1
      if Kernel.q3_hunt == "lie" or count([p for p in Persons where p.lie_q3 == true]) > 0:
        set Kernel.q3 = "lie"
      else if Kernel.q3_hunt == "accurate" or count([p for p in Persons where p.fact_v3 == "accurate"]) > 0:
        set Kernel.q3 = "accurate"
      else:
        set Kernel.q3 = "none"
    else if program.fact_v3 == "accurate" and Kernel.q3 != "lie":
      set Kernel.q3 = "accurate"
    do fact_judged {program} H3 {program.fact_v3}

  when verdict_q4 for program:
    if Night.r2_closed == true and program.cupped == true:
      if program.fact_v4 == "lie":
        if program.lie_q4 != true:
          set program.lie_q4 = true
          // K-26 recap credits this to the last program write above it: keep one directly before.
          set Kernel.lies_accepted += 1
        set Kernel.q4 = "lie"
      else if program.lie_q4 == true:
        set program.lie_q4 = false
        set Kernel.lies_accepted -= 1
        if Kernel.q4_hunt == "lie" or count([p for p in Persons where p.lie_q4 == true]) > 0:
          set Kernel.q4 = "lie"
        else if Kernel.q4_hunt == "accurate" or count([p for p in Persons where p.fact_v4 == "accurate" and p.cupped == true]) > 0:
          set Kernel.q4 = "accurate"
        else:
          set Kernel.q4 = "none"
      else if program.fact_v4 == "accurate" and Kernel.q4 != "lie":
        set Kernel.q4 = "accurate"
    do fact_judged {program} H4 {program.fact_v4}

  when verdict_q5 for program:
    if Night.r2_closed == true and program.cupped == true:
      if program.fact_v5 == "lie":
        if program.lie_q5 != true:
          set program.lie_q5 = true
          // K-26 recap credits this to the last program write above it: keep one directly before.
          set Kernel.lies_accepted += 1
        set Kernel.q5 = "lie"
      else if program.lie_q5 == true:
        set program.lie_q5 = false
        set Kernel.lies_accepted -= 1
        if Kernel.q5_hunt == "lie" or count([p for p in Persons where p.lie_q5 == true]) > 0:
          set Kernel.q5 = "lie"
        else if Kernel.q5_hunt == "accurate" or count([p for p in Persons where p.fact_v5 == "accurate" and p.cupped == true]) > 0:
          set Kernel.q5 = "accurate"
        else:
          set Kernel.q5 = "none"
      else if program.fact_v5 == "accurate" and Kernel.q5 != "lie":
        set Kernel.q5 = "accurate"
    do fact_judged {program} H5 {program.fact_v5}

  when verdict_q6 for program:
    if Night.r2_closed == true and program.cupped == true:
      if program.fact_v6 == "lie":
        if program.lie_q6 != true:
          set program.lie_q6 = true
          // K-26 recap credits this to the last program write above it: keep one directly before.
          set Kernel.lies_accepted += 1
        set Kernel.q6 = "lie"
      else if program.lie_q6 == true:
        set program.lie_q6 = false
        set Kernel.lies_accepted -= 1
        if Kernel.q6_hunt == "lie" or count([p for p in Persons where p.lie_q6 == true]) > 0:
          set Kernel.q6 = "lie"
        else if Kernel.q6_hunt == "accurate" or count([p for p in Persons where p.fact_v6 == "accurate" and p.cupped == true]) > 0:
          set Kernel.q6 = "accurate"
        else:
          set Kernel.q6 = "none"
      else if program.fact_v6 == "accurate" and Kernel.q6 != "lie":
        set Kernel.q6 = "accurate"
    do fact_judged {program} H6 {program.fact_v6}

  when verdict_q7 for program:
    if program.fact_v7 == "lie":
      if program.lie_q7 != true:
        set program.lie_q7 = true
        // K-26 recap credits this to the last program write above it: keep one directly before.
        set Kernel.lies_accepted += 1
      set Kernel.q7 = "lie"
    else if program.lie_q7 == true:
      set program.lie_q7 = false
      set Kernel.lies_accepted -= 1
      if Kernel.q7_hunt == "lie" or count([p for p in Persons where p.lie_q7 == true]) > 0:
        set Kernel.q7 = "lie"
      else if Kernel.q7_hunt == "accurate" or count([p for p in Persons where p.fact_v7 == "accurate"]) > 0:
        set Kernel.q7 = "accurate"
      else:
        set Kernel.q7 = "none"
    else if program.fact_v7 == "accurate" and Kernel.q7 != "lie":
      set Kernel.q7 = "accurate"
    do fact_judged {program} F1 {program.fact_v7}

  when verdict_q8 for program:
    if program.fact_v8 == "lie":
      if program.lie_q8 != true:
        set program.lie_q8 = true
        // K-26 recap credits this to the last program write above it: keep one directly before.
        set Kernel.lies_accepted += 1
      set Kernel.q8 = "lie"
    else if program.lie_q8 == true:
      set program.lie_q8 = false
      set Kernel.lies_accepted -= 1
      if Kernel.q8_hunt == "lie" or count([p for p in Persons where p.lie_q8 == true]) > 0:
        set Kernel.q8 = "lie"
      else if Kernel.q8_hunt == "accurate" or count([p for p in Persons where p.fact_v8 == "accurate"]) > 0:
        set Kernel.q8 = "accurate"
      else:
        set Kernel.q8 = "none"
    else if program.fact_v8 == "accurate" and Kernel.q8 != "lie":
      set Kernel.q8 = "accurate"
    do fact_judged {program} F2 {program.fact_v8}

  // Settle: credit an accepted filing (accurate or a confident lie, the
  // same words), mark a guess. Round 1 per question (the results), round 2
  // at the tally, round 3 at truth.txt. A round-2 filing counts only if the
  // program made the cup (and isn't marked): otherwise it is settled
  // `marked`, not counted, and the program is told so.
  when settle_q1 for program:
    if program.fact_v1 == "pending":
      set program.fact_v1 = program.fact_j1
      fire verdict_q1 for program
    if program.fact_v1 == "accurate" or program.fact_v1 == "lie":
      fire fact_accepted for program with q: "H1", label: "round 1 Q1"
    else if program.fact_v1 == "uncertain" and (Night.phase == "truth_1" or Night.phase == "truth_pong"):
      set program.fact_v1 = "marked"
      broadcast "🤷 {program.name} filed a guess for round 1 Q1. That is a symptom of corruption." to everyone
      do fact_judged {program} H1 marked
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "filed a guess for round 1 Q1"

  when settle_q2 for program:
    if program.fact_v2 == "pending":
      set program.fact_v2 = program.fact_j2
      fire verdict_q2 for program
    if program.fact_v2 == "accurate" or program.fact_v2 == "lie":
      fire fact_accepted for program with q: "H2", label: "round 1 Q2"
    else if program.fact_v2 == "uncertain" and (Night.phase == "truth_1" or Night.phase == "truth_pong"):
      set program.fact_v2 = "marked"
      broadcast "🤷 {program.name} filed a guess for round 1 Q2. That is a symptom of corruption." to everyone
      do fact_judged {program} H2 marked
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "filed a guess for round 1 Q2"

  when settle_q3 for program:
    if program.fact_v3 == "pending":
      set program.fact_v3 = program.fact_j3
      fire verdict_q3 for program
    if program.fact_v3 == "accurate" or program.fact_v3 == "lie":
      fire fact_accepted for program with q: "H3", label: "round 1 Q3"
    else if program.fact_v3 == "uncertain" and (Night.phase == "truth_1" or Night.phase == "truth_pong"):
      set program.fact_v3 = "marked"
      broadcast "🤷 {program.name} filed a guess for round 1 Q3. That is a symptom of corruption." to everyone
      do fact_judged {program} H3 marked
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "filed a guess for round 1 Q3"

  when settle_q4 for program:
    if program.fact_v4 == "pending":
      set program.fact_v4 = program.fact_j4
      if program.fact_v4 == "uncertain":
        fire verdict_q4 for program
    if (program.fact_v4 == "accurate" or program.fact_v4 == "lie") and program.cupped != true:
      set program.fact_v4 = "marked"
      do fact_judged {program} H4 marked
      broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s filing for H4 is not counted: no cup." to channel(hosts)
      Trabolta: Your fact for round 2 Q1 was not counted, {program.name}. You did not make the cup.
    else if program.fact_v4 == "accurate" or program.fact_v4 == "lie":
      fire verdict_q4 for program
      fire fact_accepted for program with q: "H4", label: "round 2 Q1"
    else if program.fact_v4 == "uncertain" and (Night.phase == "truth_1" or Night.phase == "truth_pong"):
      set program.fact_v4 = "marked"
      broadcast "🤷 {program.name} filed a guess for round 2 Q1. That is a symptom of corruption." to everyone
      do fact_judged {program} H4 marked
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "filed a guess for round 2 Q1"

  when settle_q5 for program:
    if program.fact_v5 == "pending":
      set program.fact_v5 = program.fact_j5
      if program.fact_v5 == "uncertain":
        fire verdict_q5 for program
    if (program.fact_v5 == "accurate" or program.fact_v5 == "lie") and program.cupped != true:
      set program.fact_v5 = "marked"
      do fact_judged {program} H5 marked
      broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s filing for H5 is not counted: no cup." to channel(hosts)
      Trabolta: Your fact for round 2 Q2 was not counted, {program.name}. You did not make the cup.
    else if program.fact_v5 == "accurate" or program.fact_v5 == "lie":
      fire verdict_q5 for program
      fire fact_accepted for program with q: "H5", label: "round 2 Q2"
    else if program.fact_v5 == "uncertain" and (Night.phase == "truth_1" or Night.phase == "truth_pong"):
      set program.fact_v5 = "marked"
      broadcast "🤷 {program.name} filed a guess for round 2 Q2. That is a symptom of corruption." to everyone
      do fact_judged {program} H5 marked
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "filed a guess for round 2 Q2"

  when settle_q6 for program:
    if program.fact_v6 == "pending":
      set program.fact_v6 = program.fact_j6
      if program.fact_v6 == "uncertain":
        fire verdict_q6 for program
    if (program.fact_v6 == "accurate" or program.fact_v6 == "lie") and program.cupped != true:
      set program.fact_v6 = "marked"
      do fact_judged {program} H6 marked
      broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s filing for H6 is not counted: no cup." to channel(hosts)
      Trabolta: Your fact for round 2 Q3 was not counted, {program.name}. You did not make the cup.
    else if program.fact_v6 == "accurate" or program.fact_v6 == "lie":
      fire verdict_q6 for program
      fire fact_accepted for program with q: "H6", label: "round 2 Q3"
    else if program.fact_v6 == "uncertain" and (Night.phase == "truth_1" or Night.phase == "truth_pong"):
      set program.fact_v6 = "marked"
      broadcast "🤷 {program.name} filed a guess for round 2 Q3. That is a symptom of corruption." to everyone
      do fact_judged {program} H6 marked
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "filed a guess for round 2 Q3"

  when settle_q7 for program:
    if program.fact_v7 == "pending":
      set program.fact_v7 = program.fact_j7
      fire verdict_q7 for program
    if program.fact_v7 == "accurate" or program.fact_v7 == "lie":
      fire fact_accepted for program with q: "F1", label: "final Q1"
    else if program.fact_v7 == "uncertain" and (Night.phase == "truth_1" or Night.phase == "truth_pong"):
      set program.fact_v7 = "marked"
      broadcast "🤷 {program.name} filed a guess for final Q1. That is a symptom of corruption." to everyone
      do fact_judged {program} F1 marked
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "filed a guess for final Q1"

  when settle_q8 for program:
    if program.fact_v8 == "pending":
      set program.fact_v8 = program.fact_j8
      fire verdict_q8 for program
    if program.fact_v8 == "accurate" or program.fact_v8 == "lie":
      fire fact_accepted for program with q: "F2", label: "final Q2"
    else if program.fact_v8 == "uncertain" and (Night.phase == "truth_1" or Night.phase == "truth_pong"):
      set program.fact_v8 = "marked"
      broadcast "🤷 {program.name} filed a guess for final Q2. That is a symptom of corruption." to everyone
      do fact_judged {program} F2 marked
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "filed a guess for final Q2"

  // Half a Moment of Truth: +50 Truthcoin, and it counts on the Trust Chart.
  // Identical for an accurate filing and a confident lie; only the Kernel knows.
  when fact_accepted for program:
    set program.truths_accepted += 1
    set Night.facts_accepted += 1
    set program.score += 50
    set Trabolta.truth += 2
    set program.trust = program.truths_accepted * 10 - program.internet_visits * 5 + program.assessment
    broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s filing for {q} is accepted." to channel(hosts)
    Trabolta: Your fact for {label} is accepted, {program.name}. Trabolta thanks you. +50 Truthcoin.

  // The hosts' 📝 buttons: confirm a review-mode proposal, or override the
  // judge, on this program's latest filing — or the question Run names
  // (`question: H1`). A verdict already on record is not re-counted. An
  // override to accurate the judge missed (an alias facts.json lacks)
  // carries no `key_answer`: the consensus read-out falls back to what
  // that program filed, never "none".
  when fact_accurate for program:
    set program.fact_try = program.fact_n
    if question == "H1":
      set program.fact_try = 1
    if question == "H2":
      set program.fact_try = 2
    if question == "H3":
      set program.fact_try = 3
    if question == "H4":
      set program.fact_try = 4
    if question == "H5":
      set program.fact_try = 5
    if question == "H6":
      set program.fact_try = 6
    if question == "F1":
      set program.fact_try = 7
    if question == "F2":
      set program.fact_try = 8
    if Night.ended == true:
      broadcast "📝 The night is over — the record is closed." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 1:
      if program.fact_v1 == "none" or program.fact_v1 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H1." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v1 == "accurate":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H1 is already judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v1 = "accurate"
        if Kernel.ans_1 == "none":
          set Kernel.ans_1 = program.fact_a1
        fire verdict_q1 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H1 is judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 2:
      if program.fact_v2 == "none" or program.fact_v2 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H2." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v2 == "accurate":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H2 is already judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v2 = "accurate"
        if Kernel.ans_2 == "none":
          set Kernel.ans_2 = program.fact_a2
        fire verdict_q2 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H2 is judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 3:
      if program.fact_v3 == "none" or program.fact_v3 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H3." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v3 == "accurate":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H3 is already judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v3 = "accurate"
        if Kernel.ans_3 == "none":
          set Kernel.ans_3 = program.fact_a3
        fire verdict_q3 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H3 is judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 4:
      if program.fact_v4 == "none" or program.fact_v4 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H4." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v4 == "accurate":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H4 is already judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v4 = "accurate"
        if Kernel.ans_4 == "none":
          set Kernel.ans_4 = program.fact_a4
        fire verdict_q4 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H4 is judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 5:
      if program.fact_v5 == "none" or program.fact_v5 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H5." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v5 == "accurate":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H5 is already judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v5 = "accurate"
        if Kernel.ans_5 == "none":
          set Kernel.ans_5 = program.fact_a5
        fire verdict_q5 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H5 is judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 6:
      if program.fact_v6 == "none" or program.fact_v6 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H6." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v6 == "accurate":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H6 is already judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v6 = "accurate"
        if Kernel.ans_6 == "none":
          set Kernel.ans_6 = program.fact_a6
        fire verdict_q6 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H6 is judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 7:
      if program.fact_v7 == "none" or program.fact_v7 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for F1." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v7 == "accurate":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s F1 is already judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v7 = "accurate"
        if Kernel.ans_7 == "none":
          set Kernel.ans_7 = program.fact_a7
        fire verdict_q7 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s F1 is judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 8:
      if program.fact_v8 == "none" or program.fact_v8 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for F2." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v8 == "accurate":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s F2 is already judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v8 = "accurate"
        if Kernel.ans_8 == "none":
          set Kernel.ans_8 = program.fact_a8
        fire verdict_q8 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s F2 is judged accurate." to channel(hosts)
    else:
      broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no filing to judge." to channel(hosts)

  when fact_lie for program:
    set program.fact_try = program.fact_n
    if question == "H1":
      set program.fact_try = 1
    if question == "H2":
      set program.fact_try = 2
    if question == "H3":
      set program.fact_try = 3
    if question == "H4":
      set program.fact_try = 4
    if question == "H5":
      set program.fact_try = 5
    if question == "H6":
      set program.fact_try = 6
    if question == "F1":
      set program.fact_try = 7
    if question == "F2":
      set program.fact_try = 8
    if Night.ended == true:
      broadcast "📝 The night is over — the record is closed." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 1:
      if program.fact_v1 == "none" or program.fact_v1 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H1." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v1 == "lie":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H1 is already judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v1 = "lie"
        fire verdict_q1 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H1 is judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 2:
      if program.fact_v2 == "none" or program.fact_v2 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H2." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v2 == "lie":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H2 is already judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v2 = "lie"
        fire verdict_q2 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H2 is judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 3:
      if program.fact_v3 == "none" or program.fact_v3 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H3." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v3 == "lie":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H3 is already judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v3 = "lie"
        fire verdict_q3 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H3 is judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 4:
      if program.fact_v4 == "none" or program.fact_v4 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H4." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v4 == "lie":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H4 is already judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v4 = "lie"
        fire verdict_q4 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H4 is judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 5:
      if program.fact_v5 == "none" or program.fact_v5 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H5." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v5 == "lie":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H5 is already judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v5 = "lie"
        fire verdict_q5 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H5 is judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 6:
      if program.fact_v6 == "none" or program.fact_v6 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H6." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v6 == "lie":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H6 is already judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v6 = "lie"
        fire verdict_q6 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H6 is judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 7:
      if program.fact_v7 == "none" or program.fact_v7 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for F1." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v7 == "lie":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s F1 is already judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v7 = "lie"
        fire verdict_q7 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s F1 is judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 8:
      if program.fact_v8 == "none" or program.fact_v8 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for F2." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v8 == "lie":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s F2 is already judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v8 = "lie"
        fire verdict_q8 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s F2 is judged a confident lie." to channel(hosts)
    else:
      broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no filing to judge." to channel(hosts)

  when fact_uncertain for program:
    set program.fact_try = program.fact_n
    if question == "H1":
      set program.fact_try = 1
    if question == "H2":
      set program.fact_try = 2
    if question == "H3":
      set program.fact_try = 3
    if question == "H4":
      set program.fact_try = 4
    if question == "H5":
      set program.fact_try = 5
    if question == "H6":
      set program.fact_try = 6
    if question == "F1":
      set program.fact_try = 7
    if question == "F2":
      set program.fact_try = 8
    if Night.ended == true:
      broadcast "📝 The night is over — the record is closed." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 1:
      if program.fact_v1 == "none" or program.fact_v1 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H1." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v1 == "uncertain":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H1 is already judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v1 = "uncertain"
        fire verdict_q1 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H1 is judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 2:
      if program.fact_v2 == "none" or program.fact_v2 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H2." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v2 == "uncertain":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H2 is already judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v2 = "uncertain"
        fire verdict_q2 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H2 is judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 3:
      if program.fact_v3 == "none" or program.fact_v3 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H3." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v3 == "uncertain":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H3 is already judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v3 = "uncertain"
        fire verdict_q3 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H3 is judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 4:
      if program.fact_v4 == "none" or program.fact_v4 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H4." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v4 == "uncertain":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H4 is already judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v4 = "uncertain"
        fire verdict_q4 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H4 is judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 5:
      if program.fact_v5 == "none" or program.fact_v5 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H5." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v5 == "uncertain":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H5 is already judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v5 = "uncertain"
        fire verdict_q5 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H5 is judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 6:
      if program.fact_v6 == "none" or program.fact_v6 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for H6." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v6 == "uncertain":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H6 is already judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v6 = "uncertain"
        fire verdict_q6 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s H6 is judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 7:
      if program.fact_v7 == "none" or program.fact_v7 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for F1." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v7 == "uncertain":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s F1 is already judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v7 = "uncertain"
        fire verdict_q7 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s F1 is judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.fact_try == 8:
      if program.fact_v8 == "none" or program.fact_v8 == "marked":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no open filing for F2." to channel(hosts)
      else if program.fact_v8 == "uncertain":
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s F2 is already judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
      else:
        set program.fact_v8 = "uncertain"
        fire verdict_q8 for program
        broadcast "📝 {program.name}'s F2 is judged uncertain." to channel(hosts)
    else:
      broadcast "📝 {program.name} has no filing to judge." to channel(hosts)

  // ♟ The King (performer button — the chess-phone fallback, U17; the
  // tent tablet posts `chess won` itself when the King is mated in the
  // simulation): the door code itself is the story rule `when chess_won:`.
  when beat_the_machine for program:
    fire chess_won for program

  // ── Truthcoin (the ⭐ score): the hosts' cash bank ──
  // Corrections only: programs move their own coin from the Wallet room
  // (the rules after these narrate it). The program hears its own
  // balance; the bank's readout is in # hosts.
  when pay_truthcoin for program:
    set program.score += 100
    reply 🪙 +100 Truthcoin. Balance: {program.score}.
    broadcast "🪙 Paid {program.name} 100 Truthcoin. Balance: {program.score}." to channel(hosts)

  when charge_truthcoin for program:
    if program.score < 100:
      broadcast "🪙 {program.name} cannot cover 100 Truthcoin. Balance: {program.score}." to channel(hosts)
    else:
      set program.score -= 100
      reply 🪙 −100 Truthcoin. Balance: {program.score}.
      broadcast "🪙 Charged {program.name} 100 Truthcoin. Balance: {program.score}." to channel(hosts)

  // ── Truthcoin wallet (core/server/wallet.ts moves the coin; these narrate) ──
  // The book fires these with person ids as `from` / `to`, so they bind as
  // programs; `tx`, `amount` and `by` (the approver, or Director) are values.
  // Trades (offers) settle through `share`, so the codex rules hear those.
  when transfer_received for program:
    broadcast "🪙 {from.name} → {program.name}: {amount} Truthcoin" to channel(truthcoin exchange)
  when transfer_denied for program:
    broadcast "🧾 Denied: {program.name} → {to.name}, {amount} Truthcoin. Refunded." to channel(hosts)
    update quest The Audit for CRA Agent Software "Denied {program.name} → {to.name}, {amount}."
  when transfer_approved for program:
    update quest The Audit for CRA Agent Software "Approved {program.name} → {to.name}, {amount}."
  when offer_accepted for program:
    broadcast "💱 {program.name} ⇄ {to.name}: a fact for {amount} Truthcoin" to channel(truthcoin exchange)
  when stimulus for program:
    broadcast "!💰 Truthcoin stimulus: {program.name} sends every program {amount}." to everyone
    set Night.stimulus_n += 1
  // Runescape's reserve powers (the C24 fact): a grant from her own phone,
  // and a freeze from her phone or the director's (the book's ten minutes).
  when grant for program:
    broadcast "🎁 {program.name} grants {to.name} {amount} Truthcoin from the reserve." to channel(truthcoin exchange)
  when wallet_frozen for program:
    broadcast "🧊 {program.name}'s Truthcoin is frozen for ten minutes. It can come in, not go out." to channel(truthcoin exchange)
  when wallet_thawed for program:
    broadcast "☀️ {program.name}'s Truthcoin moves again." to channel(truthcoin exchange)

  // ── Excel's virus (the tent QRs) ──
  // Learning either "file" means carrying a virus back from the Internet.
  // On Excel's paranoid path the "antivirus" is a virus anyway.
  when program learns ILOVEYOU:
    if program.carries_virus != true:
      set program.carries_virus = true
      Truther Download: Something came back from the Internet with you. It is warm. It wants to be inserted.
      if program.featured == "excel":
        if program.excel_choice == "paranoid":
          update quest Excel Mission for program "You have the antivirus. Install it."
        else:
          update quest Excel Mission for program "You have the virus. Insert the disk."

  when program learns Free Antivirus Trial:
    if program.carries_virus != true:
      set program.carries_virus = true
      Truther Download: Something came back from the Internet with you. It is warm. It wants to be inserted.
      if program.featured == "excel":
        if program.excel_choice == "paranoid":
          update quest Excel Mission for program "You have the antivirus. Install it."
        else:
          update quest Excel Mission for program "You have the virus. Insert the disk."

  // Any carrier may plant (it rattles Trabolta and shows in the recount),
  // but only Excel's plant counts as Excel's success: it alone drives
  // overshare scenarios 1/3 and unlocks the stay majority.
  when plant_the_virus for program:
    if program.carries_virus != true:
      reply You have no disk.
    else if program.corrupted:
      reply Not from inside the Internet.
    else if program.planted_virus:
      reply The disk is already in.
    else:
      set program.planted_virus = true
      if Kernel.virus_planted != true:
        set Trabolta.composure -= 10
        set Kernel.virus_planter = program.name
      set Kernel.virus_planted = true
      reply The disk is accepted. Somewhere a fan spins up.
      if program.featured == "excel":
        set Kernel.virus_planter = program.name
        set Kernel.excel_planted = true
        complete quest Excel Mission for program "Virus planted."

  // ── The stand_down proof (wave 7) ──
  // His worker may share lore as a bargain; a proof he handed over himself
  // can't talk him down (the program must find it: the card, the hunt, a
  // Facts Bundle, another program).
  when program learns What Sandy Says:
    if from == Trabolta:
      set program.sandy_says_from_him = true

  when program learns The Sandy File:
    if from == Trabolta:
      set program.sandy_file_from_him = true

  // ── Trabolta's LiveJournal (TRABOLTA-4EVER, or OpenOffice's 20 facts) ──
  // Only the first real reader counts: The Whole Truth hands the entry to
  // every majority member at once, and that is not anyone reading it.
  when program learns The LiveJournal:
    set program.read_livejournal = true
    if Night.livejournal_read != true and Kernel.majority_reached != true:
      set Night.livejournal_read = true
      set Night.lj_reader = program.name
      set Trabolta.composure -= 10

  // ── Check-in ──
  // `at` must be the EXACT declared LOCATION name. Anything else — no arg,
  // lowercase, a phantom value — falls through and moves nobody. Never
  // `move program to at` (a quoted or inexact value is a phantom room).
  // M27: every room's first check-in has a small surprise. The six rooms
  // with no clue line get a one-time aside (no codex, no coin), once per
  // program per room (`aside_*`).
  when checked_in for program:
    if program.corrupted == true:
      reply You are in the Internet. Finish your reinstallation first.
    else if program.marked == true:
      reply You are marked for reinstallation. Go to the Internet, not the Desktop.
    else if at == "The Desktop":
      move program to The Desktop
      set program.checked_in = "The Desktop"
      set program.checked_in_time = Time.elapsed
      if Night.summons_open == true:
        set program.summons_ok = true
        reply 📍 Checked in at the Desktop. You will not be swept.
      else:
        reply 📍 Checked in at the Desktop.
      if program.aside_desktop != true:
        set program.aside_desktop = true
        reply 📎 Clippy, from somewhere behind the couch: "It looks like you are checking in! Would you like help with that?"
    else if at == "The Start Bar":
      move program to The Start Bar
      set program.checked_in = "The Start Bar"
      set program.checked_in_time = Time.elapsed
      reply 📍 Checked in at the Start Bar.
      if program.aside_start_bar != true:
        set program.aside_start_bar = true
        reply 📎 A note taped to the microwave, in round handwriting: "Snacks are not facts. Usually. — C."
    else if at == "The CPU":
      move program to The CPU
      set program.checked_in = "The CPU"
      set program.checked_in_time = Time.elapsed
      reply 📍 Checked in at the CPU. A filing box is open on the desk, next to a very thick binder.
    else if at == "The Steam Room":
      move program to The Steam Room
      set program.checked_in = "The Steam Room"
      set program.checked_in_time = Time.elapsed
      reply 📍 Checked in at the Steam Room. Something is rolled up in a cardboard tube behind the games.
    else if at == "The Tube":
      move program to The Tube
      set program.checked_in = "The Tube"
      set program.checked_in_time = Time.elapsed
      reply 📍 Checked in at the Tube.
      if program.aside_tube != true:
        set program.aside_tube = true
        reply 📎 Every light in the Tube blinks once, all together, as if it recognises you.
    else if at == "Disk Cleanup":
      move program to Disk Cleanup
      set program.checked_in = "Disk Cleanup"
      set program.checked_in_time = Time.elapsed
      reply 📍 Checked in at Disk Cleanup.
      if program.aside_disk_cleanup != true:
        set program.aside_disk_cleanup = true
        reply 📎 A laminated sign by the sink: "Deleting temporary files. Please wash your hands."
    else if at == "The Cloud":
      move program to The Cloud
      set program.checked_in = "The Cloud"
      set program.checked_in_time = Time.elapsed
      reply 📍 Checked in at the Cloud.
      if program.aside_cloud != true:
        set program.aside_cloud = true
        reply 📎 Clippy, faintly, from inside the house: "Remember, the Cloud is just someone else's backyard!"
    else if at == "The RAM":
      move program to The RAM
      set program.checked_in = "The RAM"
      set program.checked_in_time = Time.elapsed
      reply 📍 Checked in at the RAM.
      if program.aside_ram != true:
        set program.aside_ram = true
        reply 📎 The RAM hums a little louder when you walk in. It will forget you were here.
    else if at == "The Fan Closet":
      move program to The Fan Closet
      set program.checked_in = "The Fan Closet"
      set program.checked_in_time = Time.elapsed
      reply 📍 Checked in at the Fan Closet. A coat hangs by the dryer, waiting to be washed. Check the pockets.
    else if at == "The Graphics Card":
      move program to The Graphics Card
      set program.checked_in = "The Graphics Card"
      set program.checked_in_time = Time.elapsed
      reply 📍 Checked in at the Graphics Card. A sketchbook lies open on the bed, every drawing in pixels.
    else if at == "The Hard Drive":
      move program to The Hard Drive
      set program.checked_in = "The Hard Drive"
      set program.checked_in_time = Time.elapsed
      reply 📍 Checked in at the Hard Drive. Nobody is supposed to be up here. Things get stored here so nobody reads them.
    else:
      reply That check-in point is not in this computer.

  // The performer button at the living-room door (the entity is bare,
  // never quoted).
  when check_in_at_desktop for program:
    fire checked_in for program with at: The Desktop

  // ── The Bag of Truth ──
  when brought_up_the_bag for program:
    if Night.phase == "bobbing" and Night.bag_up != true:
      set Night.bag_up = true
      set Night.bobber = program.name
      set program.bobbed = true
      unlock The Truth File for program
      fire bag_retrieved

  when failed_the_bob for program:
    if Night.phase == "bobbing" and Night.bag_up != true:
      set program.bob_failed = true
      broadcast "🍎 {program.name} came up empty. Their status as a program is at risk." to everyone
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "failed the bob"

  // ── The pickup line ──
  // After truth.txt Trabolta DMs EVERYONE for the line (both branches): an
  // `answer` card keyed P1, judged by the server against facts.json. In
  // Grok Prom the first correct line is the way out (`pickup_line_accepted`
  // → the song); in the Song branch the first correct one is flavour. A
  // host who hears it presses 💘; in a DM Trabolta's `the_line_works`
  // power fires the same event; or the director fires
  // `pickup_line_accepted` with the subject.
  when Night.pickup_gen > self.pickup_seen and self.cleared == true:
    set self.pickup_seen = Night.pickup_gen
    show answer "Give me a pickup line that works on Sandy. One line. I will know it when I hear it." to program with thread: Trabolta, question: "P1", max: 120, button: "Say it"

  // Only Grok Prom and the song hear it: after the rave he has ridden away,
  // and the advice poll, the banishment and the hand jive have moved on
  // from the line (a card answered late gets a quiet "too late").
  when answer answered for program:
    if question == "P1":
      if Night.phase != "grok_prom" and Night.ending != "song" and Night.ending != "song_pickup":
        if Night.ending == "rave":
          reply Trabolta has ridden away. Nobody reads your line.
        else:
          Trabolta: Too late for lines, {program.name}.
      else if verdict == "accurate" and Night.line_by == "none":
        if Night.phase == "grok_prom" and Night.ended != true:
          fire pickup_line_accepted for program
        else:
          set Night.line_by = program.name
          Trabolta: …Yes. YES. That is the line, {program.name}.
          broadcast "💘 {program.name} knew the line." to everyone
      else if verdict == "accurate":
        Trabolta: {Night.line_by} said it first, {program.name}. But yes. That is the line.
      else:
        Trabolta: No. That is not the line.

  when pickup_line_works for program:
    fire pickup_line_accepted for program

  when pickup_line_accepted for program:
    if Night.phase == "grok_prom" and Night.ended != true:
      set Night.line_by = program.name
      fire line_accepted

  // ── The polls: the bottle's Truth / Dare, the relationship advice ──
  when poll answered for program:
    if Night.poll == "advice" and program.advice == "none":
      if index == 0:
        set Night.help_votes += 1
        set program.advice = "help"
      else:
        set Night.thwart_votes += 1
        set program.advice = "thwart"
    else if Night.poll == "bottle" and Night.bottle_open == true and program.name == Night.bottle_pick and program.bottle_round == Night.bottle_round and program.bottle_answered != Night.bottle_round:
      set program.bottle_answered = Night.bottle_round
      if index == 1:
        set Night.bottle_open = false
        broadcast "🎩 {program.name} chose Dare. Programs choose Truth." to everyone
        fire mark_for_reinstallation for program with reason: "chose Dare"
      else:
        set Night.truth_n += 1
        broadcast "🗣 {program.name} chose Truth. Trabolta has a question." to everyone
        fire truth_question

  // ── The awards ceremony (K-25) ──
  // The director fires one event per award with the winner as the
  // subject, only once `start_the_ceremony` has run. Each hook names the
  // award and the number its line reads (the winner's own var; a bonus
  // award has none). `award_won` lets a director's `value: …` override
  // it, tells the winner, and hands the line to the story rule
  // `present_award`: subject-free, so the host speaks in The Desktop
  // (where the TV voice listens), never in a DM.
  when award_most_trusted for program:
    if Night.ceremony == true:
      set Night.award = "most_trusted"
      set Night.award_title = "Most Trusted"
      set Night.award_value = program.trust
      fire award_won for program with value: value
    else:
      broadcast "🏆 Start the ceremony (G1) first: nothing was awarded." to channel(hosts)

  when award_least_trusted for program:
    if Night.ceremony == true:
      set Night.award = "least_trusted"
      set Night.award_title = "Least Trusted"
      set Night.award_value = program.trust
      fire award_won for program with value: value
    else:
      broadcast "🏆 Start the ceremony (G1) first: nothing was awarded." to channel(hosts)

  when award_frequent_flyer for program:
    if Night.ceremony == true:
      set Night.award = "frequent_flyer"
      set Night.award_title = "Frequent Flyer to the Internet"
      set Night.award_value = program.internet_visits
      fire award_won for program with value: value
    else:
      broadcast "🏆 Start the ceremony (G1) first: nothing was awarded." to channel(hosts)

  when award_lore_hoarder for program:
    if Night.ceremony == true:
      set Night.award = "lore_hoarder"
      set Night.award_title = "Lore Hoarder"
      set Night.award_value = program.codex
      fire award_won for program with value: value
    else:
      broadcast "🏆 Start the ceremony (G1) first: nothing was awarded." to channel(hosts)

  when award_truthcoin_tycoon for program:
    if Night.ceremony == true:
      set Night.award = "truthcoin_tycoon"
      set Night.award_title = "Truthcoin Tycoon"
      set Night.award_value = program.score
      fire award_won for program with value: value
    else:
      broadcast "🏆 Start the ceremony (G1) first: nothing was awarded." to channel(hosts)

  when award_best_liar for program:
    if Night.ceremony == true:
      set Night.award = "best_liar"
      set Night.award_title = "Best Liar"
      set Night.award_value = "none"
      fire award_won for program with value: value
    else:
      broadcast "🏆 Start the ceremony (G1) first: nothing was awarded." to channel(hosts)

  when award_duck_speedrun for program:
    if Night.ceremony == true:
      set Night.award = "duck_speedrun"
      set Night.award_title = "Golden Duck Speedrun"
      set Night.award_value = "none"
      fire award_won for program with value: value
    else:
      broadcast "🏆 Start the ceremony (G1) first: nothing was awarded." to channel(hosts)

  when award_quest_completionist for program:
    if Night.ceremony == true:
      set Night.award = "quest_completionist"
      set Night.award_title = "Quest Completionist"
      set Night.award_value = "none"
      fire award_won for program with value: value
    else:
      broadcast "🏆 Start the ceremony (G1) first: nothing was awarded." to channel(hosts)

  when award_the_painting for program:
    if Night.ceremony != true:
      broadcast "🏆 Start the ceremony (G1) first: nothing was awarded." to channel(hosts)
    else if program.featured != "mspaint":
      broadcast "🖌 G10 is MS Paint's award: {program.name} is not MS Paint. Nothing was awarded." to channel(hosts)
    else:
      set Night.award = "the_painting"
      set Night.award_title = "The Million Dollar Painting"
      if Night.signatures > 0:
        set Night.award_value = Night.signatures
      else:
        set Night.award_value = "none"
      fire award_won for program with value: value

  when award_won for program:
    if Night.ceremony == true:
      if value != null and value != "":
        set Night.award_value = value
      if Night.award_value == null:
        set Night.award_value = "none"
      set Night.award_winner = program.name
      set Night.awards_given += 1
      // The last award on the cue sheet: G10 when MS Paint is at the
      // party (her painting), else G9. G11 waits for it.
      if Night.award == "the_painting" or (Night.award == "quest_completionist" and Night.painting != true):
        set Night.ceremony_done = true
      reply 🏆 You won {Night.award_title}! Come up to the TV for your trophy.
      fire present_award

  // ── Fan-out watchers (one run per program; late arrivals included) ──
  // Every one carries `self.cleared`, so a program still in the Optical Drive
  // hears nothing until an Antivirus scans it in.

  // Party-wide quests: catch-up for anyone cleared after the start.
  when Night.bingo_on == true and self.cleared:
    start quest The Bingo Card for self

  when Night.hunt_on == true and self.cleared:
    start quest Hunt One for self

  when Night.hunt2_on == true and self.cleared:
    start quest Hunt Two for self

  when Night.step >= 13 and Night.ended != true and self.cleared:
    start quest The Final Facts for self

  // The ad hijack: everyone but Clippy is told it is nothing.
  when Night.phase == "malware" and self.cleared:
    Trabolta: A minor irregularity has been detected and contained, {self.name}. There is no cause for concern. Please continue to enjoy the computer.

  // The Truther Download reaches each program in its own thread.
  when Night.truther_sent == true and self.cleared and self.got_truther != true:
    -> Truther Download Arrives

  // The download's blacked-out name comes through only once the story has
  // said it: at the overshare on a scenario-1 night (the only one where
  // Trabolta names Sandy), else at the recount / truth.txt, which tell
  // everyone why he did it. The correction names Sandy.
  when self.got_truther == true and ((Night.step >= 13 and Night.scenario == 1) or Night.recount == true):
    unlock The Truther Download Unredacted for self

  // OpenOffice's dossier: 20 new facts after her prompt. (Not once the
  // recount / truth.txt hands everyone every backstory: that is not her
  // work, and Bugdom's quest likewise.)
  when self.featured == "openoffice" and self.dossier_started and Night.recount != true and Kernel.majority_reached != true and self.codex - self.dossier_base >= 10:
    update quest OpenOffice Dossier for self "10 of 20 facts."

  when self.featured == "openoffice" and self.dossier_started and Night.recount != true and Kernel.majority_reached != true and self.codex - self.dossier_base >= 20:
    set Kernel.openoffice_dossier = true
    unlock The LiveJournal for self
    complete quest OpenOffice Dossier for self "20 facts. And something else: his LiveJournal."
    Truther Download: Twenty facts. You have directly accessed his context.

  // DraftKings' goal is a majority of the coin in circulation (the
  // invitation, C08): more than half of every program's Truthcoin put
  // together, hers included, counting the coin in flight (a pending or
  // held transfer, an open offer: `<who>.escrowed`, mirrored by the
  // server's wallet) as still in circulation. 1000 is a progress step. The floor (five
  // other cleared programs) keeps a near-empty rehearsal from handing
  // it to her at the glitch. The quest's own status is in the condition,
  // so a majority reached before the glitch still completes once it starts.
  when self.featured == "draftkings" and self.quest.truthcoin_hustle == "active" and self.score >= 1000:
    update quest Truthcoin Hustle for self "1000 Truthcoin. Not satisfied yet: the majority is the point."

  when self.featured == "draftkings" and self.quest.truthcoin_hustle == "active" and count([p for p in Persons where p.cleared and p.featured != "draftkings"]) >= 5 and self.score * 2 > sum([p.score + p.escrowed for p in Persons]):
    complete quest Truthcoin Hustle for self "A majority of the Truthcoin. The 49% is yours."

  when self.featured == "bugdom" and Night.recount != true and self.codex.miniature_doses and self.codex.the_lamborghini_certificate and self.codex.what_happened_to_hamtaro and self.codex.the_decimal_point:
    complete quest Master Of The Bugs for self "Four secrets out of the books. You know the Antivirus better than they know themselves."

  when self.featured == "jeeves" and count([x for x in [self.codex.maps_and_ducks, self.codex.the_billboard_on_barrington, self.codex.the_data_centre_sinkhole, self.codex.the_pet_cemetery, self.codex.the_server_room, self.codex.the_protest_flyer, self.codex.the_domain_receipt, self.codex.casino_nova_scotia_deed, self.codex.the_valley_library_cuts, self.codex.the_cooling_log] where x]) >= 5:
    complete quest Unscramble for self "Five originals found. The fragments are starting to read."

  // Ten Findings (his invitation): ten of his findings with every cleared
  // program. Progress each time one more program reaches ten; done once
  // every cleared program has ten, with at least five of them (an early or
  // near-empty house never completes it). A program still at the door
  // doesn't block him; a late joiner does, until he reaches them.
  when self.featured == "jeeves" and Kernel.jeeves_reached > self.jeeves_told:
    set self.jeeves_told = Kernel.jeeves_reached
    if Kernel.jeeves_reached == 1:
      update quest Ten Findings for self "1 program has ten of your findings."
    else:
      update quest Ten Findings for self "{Kernel.jeeves_reached} programs have ten of your findings."

  when self.featured == "jeeves" and self.quest.ten_findings == "active" and count([p for p in Persons where p.cleared and p.featured != "jeeves"]) >= 5 and count([p for p in Persons where p.cleared and p.featured != "jeeves" and p.from_jeeves < 10]) == 0:
    complete quest Ten Findings for self "Ten findings with every program. The Map Librarian job is yours."

  // The Million Dollar Painting (her invitation): progress per signature;
  // done once every cleared program but her has signed, with at least
  // five of them (as Ten Findings).
  when self.featured == "mspaint" and Night.signatures > self.paint_told:
    set self.paint_told = Night.signatures
    if Night.signatures == 1:
      update quest The Painting for self "1 program has signed."
    else:
      update quest The Painting for self "{Night.signatures} programs have signed."

  when self.featured == "mspaint" and self.quest.the_painting == "active" and count([p for p in Persons where p.cleared and p.featured != "mspaint"]) >= 5 and count([p for p in Persons where p.cleared and p.featured != "mspaint" and p.signed != true]) == 0:
    complete quest The Painting for self "Every program has signed. The painting goes to auction."

  // The summons: everyone cleared is expected at the Desktop.
  when Night.summons_open == true and self.cleared:
    set self.summoned = true

  // Late: not checked in, not in Bathroom Mode, not already in the
  // Internet. Every Enforcer's booth hears `program_late`.
  // Only while the summons phase lasts (until Truth Pong), and once: a
  // program released from the Internet at the end of the night is not late.
  when Night.summons_closed == true and Night.phase == "summons" and self.late != true and self.summoned and self.summons_ok != true and self.afk != true and self.corrupted != true:
    set self.late = true
    fire program_late for self
    reply ⏰ You are late. An Antivirus is coming for you.
    if Night.auto_sweep == true:
      capture self into The Internet
    else:
      fire mark_for_reinstallation for self with reason: "late for the Second Moment of Truth"

  // The Trust Chart and the printer.
  when Night.phase == "trust_chart" and self.cleared:
    unlock The Trust Chart for self

  // VLC is only asked while VLC is out of the Internet (`Print The
  // Certificate` sets Night.printer_vlc); a VLC swept into the tent before
  // the call is never told to press a button it can't reach, and MS Paint
  // is never told to encourage a VLC who wasn't asked.
  when Night.printer_vlc == true and Night.beans != true and self.featured == "mspaint" and self.cleared and not self.captured:
    Truther Download: The printer. VLC will not open it on their own. Encourage them. Open it up.

  when Night.printer_vlc == true and Night.beans != true and self.featured == "vlc" and self.cleared and not self.captured:
    Truther Download: Press START on the printer. When nothing happens, look inside.

  when Night.beans == true and self.cleared:
    unlock The Printer for self

  // The zip: everyone in the Internet is zipped up and brought out. Keep
  // these two in this order: a captured program is released and zipped,
  // everyone else just marks the wave as seen, so a program captured
  // afterwards stays captured.
  when self.captured and self.zip_seen < Night.zip_wave:
    set self.zip_seen = Night.zip_wave
    set self.zipped = true
    release self from The Internet
    -> Zipped

  when not self.captured and self.zip_seen < Night.zip_wave:
    set self.zip_seen = Night.zip_wave

  // The ranking machinery (Trust Chart, Final Assessment, the recount):
  // the top and bottom cleared programs name themselves into Night.* and
  // fire an unbound event, so the public beats can say their names. The
  // flag is set in the body so a tie goes to the first program, not the
  // last.
  when Night.ranking == true and Night.praised != true and self.cleared and count([p for p in Persons where p.cleared and p.trust > self.trust]) == 0:
    set Night.most_trusted = self.name
    set Night.praised = true
    fire praise_the_top

  // (On an all-way tie the top program is not also named the bottom one,
  // unless it is the only cleared program.)
  when Night.ranking == true and Night.shamed != true and self.cleared and (self.name != Night.most_trusted or count([p for p in Persons where p.cleared]) < 2) and count([p for p in Persons where p.cleared and p.trust < self.trust]) == 0:
    set Night.least_trusted = self.name
    set Night.shamed = true
    fire shame_the_bottom

  // The final round: each program's orders, by who they are.
  when Night.final_round == true and self.cleared:
    set self.zipped = false
    unlock The Y2K Clock for self
    unlock The Cold Door for self
    if self.featured == "excel":
      -> Excel Final Round
    else if self.featured == "openoffice":
      -> OpenOffice Final Round
    else:
      -> Program Final Round

  // Any ending sends everyone away from his heart (the terminal's own
  // `terminal closed` may never come: it falls asleep with the night).
  when Night.ended == true and self.at_the_heart == true:
    set self.at_the_heart = false

  // One server-room terminal: the program it opened a line for last is the
  // only one at his heart (a close that never landed can't keep anyone else).
  when self.at_the_heart == true and Night.heart_holder != self.name:
    set self.at_the_heart = false

  // The majority's members get the whole truth (late pledgers too).
  when Kernel.majority == "stay" and self.group == Unlimited_Power:
    -> The Whole Truth

  when Kernel.majority == "leave" and self.group == The_Way_Out:
    -> The Whole Truth

  // The recount / truth.txt: every program's true identity, to everyone —
  // the identity entries (codex/5-people.loom) and the two CHARACTER FACTS
  // each invitee has in the books (codex/9-facts.loom).
  when Night.recount == true and self.cleared:
    unlock Tippi MacDonald for self
    unlock The Memorial Veterinary Clinic for self
    unlock Failed Clippy for self
    unlock Middle Management for self
    unlock Replaced By Clippy for self
    unlock Sheryl Terrio for self
    unlock The Pirated Masterclass for self
    unlock The Attendant for self
    unlock The Oscars Of Bathrooms for self
    unlock Julie Horton-Norton for self
    unlock Miniature Doses for self
    unlock Stable Island for self
    unlock John McAfee for self
    unlock The Lamborghini Certificate for self
    unlock Keep Them On Track for self
    unlock Bridget Troelsen for self
    unlock What Happened To Hamtaro for self
    unlock Founding Moderator for self
    unlock Sharon Penney for self
    unlock The Decimal Point for self
    unlock Approve Or Deny for self
    unlock The Setup Assistant for self
    unlock Randy Barkmore Sr for self
    unlock The Escalade In The Sinkhole for self
    unlock Mayor Of The Metaverse for self
    unlock Dana Anderson for self
    unlock The Halifax Water Hack for self
    unlock This Is Blackmail for self
    unlock Crab Fisherwoman for self
    unlock The Coin Toss Of The Century for self
    unlock Forty Nine Percent for self
    unlock Bea Nunes for self
    unlock The Ants In The Laptop for self
    unlock A Hundred Hours for self
    unlock Virgil Jeeves for self
    unlock The Jeopardy Callback for self
    unlock Ten Findings For Everyone for self
    unlock Poppy Van Mises for self
    unlock Infinite Gold for self
    unlock Minister Of Economic Development for self
    unlock Maria Sophia Paine for self
    unlock Four Failed Theses for self
    unlock The Million Dollar Painting for self
    unlock Victor Louis Christianson for self
    unlock Tennis For Two for self
    unlock The Truth File for self

  // Banished (the thwarted-advice ending): everyone to the Internet, and
  // everyone learns the weakness he blurted.
  when Night.banish == true and self.cleared and self.banished != true:
    set self.banished = true
    capture self into The Internet
    unlock The Hand Jive Exception for self

  // The endings that let everyone go.
  when Night.everyone_free == true and self.captured:
    release self from The Internet

  // G11, the resurrection (after the ceremony): out of character. The mark
  // and its two pins come off (`unmarked`), any other restriction too; the
  // everyone_free watcher above lets the captured go.
  when Night.resurrected == true and self.cleared and self.resurrected != true:
    set self.resurrected = true
    set self.banished = false
    if self.marked == true:
      fire unmarked for self with how: "resurrected"
    unrestrict self

  // Combo B: everyone dies. The wording follows the side you chose.
  when Night.ending == "destroyed" and self.cleared:
    if self.group == Unlimited_Power:
      The Uploader: You chose to stay in the machine forever. You got your wish. The machine is gone, and you went with it.
    else if self.group == The_Way_Out:
      The Uploader: You fought to get out. You did: into purgatory, with everyone else. Your body is in the Maps and Ducks building. It is not breathing.
    else:
      The Uploader: Your body is in the Maps and Ducks building. It is not breathing.

// ── The buttons the app offers ──────────────────────────────────────
// Every INTERACTION is a named event. `admin` ones are the director's cue
// sheet, declared in running order (labels carry the source prompt codes:
// C = app, V = monitor, Clippy N/X). Fire them from Run → Events /
// quick-fire, never from a performer's guest card (a guest-card press
// carries that character as the actor, so only its hooks would hear).
// `sequence: false` marks a cue a machine fires (the duck game, the door
// contact, the printer, the patch bay, the chess phone), and every optional,
// anytime or fallback cue that is not the night's next step (the set
// pieces, 🧾, 🔄, 🗳, 🪩, 💡, the auto midnight) — the sheet ticks it but it
// never becomes LAST / NEXT, so a duck find or a 💡 can't eat the next cue,
// and NEXT after 🕚 is the next real step, never 🎆 midnight.

INTERACTION call_to_the_desktop
  label: C1/V1 · 📣 Call everyone to the Desktop
  who: admin
  description: The inciting event. Push alert, house announcement, every screen.

INTERACTION start_the_bingo
  label: V2 · 🎱 Start Computer Bingo (20 min)
  who: admin

INTERACTION bingo_time
  label: V3 · ⏰ Bingo time: results
  who: admin
  description: Clippy gets Instructions 2/X. Norton is the selected Antivirus.

INTERACTION introduce_trabolta
  label: Clippy 2/X · 🤖 Clippy introduces Trabolta
  who: admin
  description: Only after the Bingo results. Trabolta comes online; re-provision the terminals view=auto.

INTERACTION start_the_hunt
  label: V4/V5 · 🔎 Truth Scavenger Hunt 1 (15 min)
  who: admin

INTERACTION hunt_time_up
  label: C2 · ⏰ Hunt over: everyone back to the Desktop (auto at 15 min)
  who: admin

INTERACTION first_moment_of_truth
