  who: admin
  sequence: false
  description: The door contact fires this itself. Press it when the contact could not. From the Y2K hour the first opening plays The Heart (the server room opens on every phone, Trabolta speaks candidly on the server-room terminal); another opening within 2 minutes does nothing, a later one gets a short line. Before the Y2K hour it only tells # hosts. It never raises an alarm.

INTERACTION reset_server_room
