  who: admin
  sequence: false
  description: After a rehearsal, or a wrong patch the crew forgave. Clears the wrong-combination count (the patch bay forgives one again), the alarm latch and the door cutscene (the next opening from the Y2K hour plays The Heart again). Lights stay as they are (💡 restores them). The keypad lock is standalone: nothing in the story locks or unlocks it.

INTERACTION chess_won
