  who: admin
  sequence: false
  description: The tablet posts this itself, for the program who checkmated the King in the simulation. Press it, naming the winner, when the tablet (or the chess phone) could not. From the Y2K hour the winner gets The Door Code in their Codex (once; a second win changes nothing). Before that it is practice. With no winner named it only reminds # hosts to press ♟ on the winner's card.

